 "headline": "Tatum Buries Thug Life Under Triples",
 "notes": [
  "Jayson Tatum has 34 points and five threes for theInfamous, and Thug Life still stole FG% back from him anyway.",
  "Thug Life took FG% from theInfamous at 9:27pm, which is the only thing keeping that matchup from being a funeral.",
  "Gopher Gold flipped FT% off White Mambas while LeBron James shot 2-of-7 for four points, so someone else did the real work.",
  "Kyshawn George hung 33 points and five threes on Zero Fox Given while Kyrie Irving went 1-for-10, so the carry is lopsided.",
  "Nova Knicks watched Dyson Daniels post 12 assists and nine boards while the benched Naji Marshall sat on 27 points and 10 assists for the week."
 ],
